WEBVTT


1
00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:06.520
Getting lost is a beautiful thing.

2
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:14.460
And taking a drive
is the best way to do it.

3
00:00:15.380 --> 00:00:19.080
It's where I let my thoughts wander.

4
00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:23.100
Back to childhood.

5
00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:27.440
Nostalgic for the past.

6
00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:36.760
Or I find myself
embracing the beauty

7
00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:39.840
of not knowing
what's around the next corner.

8
00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:44.980
It feels like I'm searching for something,

9
00:00:45.320 --> 00:00:48.260
but I don't know what that something is.

10
00:00:49.380 --> 00:00:52.420
I think back to my defining moments,

11
00:00:52.980 --> 00:00:57.540
the ones that helped shape me
into who I would become.

12
00:00:59.640 --> 00:01:05.500
and to all those wrong turns
that led to the right decisions.

13
00:01:07.180 --> 00:01:09.820
Driving deeper and deeper into the night,

14
00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:13.900
down unknown roads,
to newfound places.

15
00:01:15.560 --> 00:01:18.920
Further and further away
from what came before,

16
00:01:19.300 --> 00:01:26.200
but closer and closer
to what comes next,

17
00:01:26.680 --> 00:01:30.660
until everything around me
is unrecognisable.

18
00:01:37.760 --> 00:01:40.880
That's when I know I'm lost.

19
00:01:45.100 --> 00:01:47.140
But we're never truly lost.

20
00:01:47.300 --> 00:01:51.660
We're searching for what moves us.
